  "content": "\n\n<p><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.wabbanode.com%252faffiliate%252fzombiecraft\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1265714/description_b26e6d1e-1414-48a8-92b5-cc22339ad9e6.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"837\" height=\"80\"></a><br><br>此材質包專為與&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/zombiecraft-the-apocalypse\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ZombieCraft</a> 搭配使用而設計</strong></p>\n<p><strong>此材質包全面重製了進度視窗、標籤頁與介面元件的紋理</strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">此材質包提供相容性的目標為</span>：<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/survivors-ascension-tree-pufferfishs-skills\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Survivors ascension tree</a></span></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><em>此材質包亦可於 ZombieCraft 之外使用</em></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
